Omnumi SDK (iOS) - Developer Documentation > 4. API-Only Mode (Custom UI Implementation) > 4.6 Error Handling in API-Only Mode

Handle API errors appropriately in your custom UI:

```swift
func handleAPIError(_ response: Any) {
    // Check response type and handle accordingly
    if let errorMessage = getErrorMessage(from: response) {
        // Check for specific error types
        if errorMessage.contains("CONSENT") {
            // Navigate to custom consent flow
        } else if errorMessage.contains("PRE_APPROVAL") {
            // Trigger pre-approval flow
        } else if errorMessage.contains("UNAUTHORIZED") {
            // Refresh token and retry
        } else {
            // Show generic error
            showError(errorMessage)
        }
    }
}
```

